      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i think my company is trying to push me out on purpose. it’s getting weird. first they changed the lunch options to stuff i’m allergic to, then my paycheck info email was delayed for no reason, and now my weekly 1-on-1 was moved to a time when i’m always in other meetings. it feels like they are trying to gaslight me into thinking i'm failing so they don't have to pay my severance. how do i start documenting this so i can fight back legally?",
